# Build artifacts (zips at the repo root from filing-bundle creation)
/*.zip
# But DO commit zips inside IP/registrations/ (those are evidentiary
# copies of deposit files for filed copyright registrations)
!IP/registrations/*.zip

# Note: IP/registrations/ and IP/trademark-search/ are now COMMITTED
# (changed from earlier ignore policy). These directories hold
# evidentiary records of filings (case numbers, deposit copies, search
# results) that benefit from version control + offline backup. Sensitive
# personal-document collections (executed NDAs, trademark applications
# with attorney WIP) remain ignored above.
